Subject: example model
Message-ID: <9Aj1L4spzAU.2_fuuLltK3cJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/9Aj1L4spzAU/m/2_fuuLltK3cJ>
