In my specs, I don’t think I had much on R-hat, n_eff, and these related post-processing things.  Along with these, we’ll also want waic and cross-validation (which will only operate if certain quantities are defined as generated quantities in the model, as discussed in the Waic-Stan paper:  http://www.stat.columbia.edu/~gelman/research/unpublished/waic_stan.pdf

Anyway, I just wanted to mention this so we don’t forget it when it becomes time to implement all this.
A

